# I306: LIKE toggles the playing song, LIKE <key> likes a song that is not playing, RATE <n> <key> rates any song and
# RATE 0 <key> clears it. Every step is read back through LIBRARY_SEARCH (liked:yes, rating:3).
OPEN selecta-test.mod
PLAY
@render 1024
LIKE
LIBRARY_SEARCH liked:yes
@results
LIKE
LIBRARY_SEARCH liked:yes
@results
LIKE local:selecta-test-mk.mod
LIBRARY_SEARCH liked:yes
@results
LIKE local:selecta-test-mk.mod
LIBRARY_SEARCH liked:yes
@results
RATE 3 local:selecta-test-mk.mod
LIBRARY_SEARCH rating:3
@results
RATE 0 local:selecta-test-mk.mod
LIBRARY_SEARCH rating:3
@results
